sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant W as worker(后台线程)
    participant DS as DataSource
    participant T as TencentSource
    participant B as 备用源(Sina/Eastmoney)
    participant SE as monitor(SignalEngine)
    participant N as Notifier
    participant CSV as append_signal
    participant R as refresh(GUI主线程)
    participant Root as Tk root

    Note over W,Root: 启动: warm_klines -> run_hud 建窗 + worker/refresh 并发

    loop 每 refresh_sec (state.paused 时跳过 fetch)
        W->>DS: fetch(code)
        DS->>T: fetch(code)
        alt 主源(腾讯)异常
            DS->>B: 顺序尝试备用源
            DS-->>W: alert_fn("主源异常,已切备用") 仅1次
        else 全部成功
            T-->>DS: (price,prev,open,ts,high,low,vol,delayed)
        end
        DS-->>W: rt 元组(8字段)
        W->>SE: monitor(stock, prev_sig, rt, settings)
        SE->>SE: 按 indicators 动态打分(默认 MA/RSI/MACD)
        SE-->>W: (text, sig, rec)  # rec 含 kline
        W->>W: 省流规则 + 冷却判定(信号/阈值/支撑压力穿越)
        alt 触发(首屏/信号变动/阈值穿越/支撑压力穿越)
            W->>CSV: append_signal(rec)  # 含去重逻辑
            W->>N: notify(line)
            alt macOS
                N->>N: notify_mac (AppleScript)
            else Linux
                N->>N: subprocess notify-send
            else Windows
                N->>N: winsound.Beep(880,200)
                N->>Root: flash_fn() 经 root.after 回主线程
                Root->>Root: _flash_window() 闪烁 ~1s
            end
        end
        W->>W: data.update(rec) [加锁 lock]
        W->>W: last_sigs[code] 记录 sig/阈值/last_price
        W->>W: time.sleep(refresh_sec)
    end

    loop 每 250ms (root.after)
        R->>R: 加锁读 data 快照
        R->>R: 更新行情行标签(价/涨跌幅/延时/信号点)
        R->>R: 更新信号提示(档位/多空)
        R->>Root: root.after(250, refresh)
    end
